<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31043" root="عوق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْقٌ</span></b>  [an inf. n.: and also used as an epithet,
signifying] One <i>who hinders, prevents, impedes,</i>
&amp;c., [see 1,] <i>people from that which is good;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْقَةٌ</span></b>  [but app. in an intensive sense]. (K.
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُوَقٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَائِقٌ</span>, in two places.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُوقٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Also <i>A place of bending,</i> or
<i>inclining, of a valley, to the right</i> or <i>left.</i> (O, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  And <i>Time:</i> so in the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا يَكُونُ ذٰلِكَ آخِرَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْقٍ</span> [<i>That will not be to the end of time</i>]. (K.)

